---
import { ArrowRight } from "iconoir-react";
---

<section class="section-block-y w-full bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white">
	<div
		class="page-section grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-8 text-left md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-10 md:gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[22%_38%_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-x-10 lg:gap-y-0 xl:gap-x-12"
	>
		<h2
			class="font-heading min-w-0 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white md:col-span-2 md:text-3xl md:leading-snug lg:col-span-1 lg:text-[1.875rem]"
		>
			Designing with clarity and intention
		</h2>

		<img
			src="/portfolio/assets/wojciech-dzwonczyk.jpg"
			alt="Wojciech Dzwonczyk - profile image"
			class="mx-auto h-auto w-[70%] min-w-0 justify-self-center rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lg sm:w-[58%] md:mx-0 md:w-full md:justify-self-stretch lg:w-full"
			width="640"
			height="800"
			loading="lazy"
			decoding="async"
		/>

		<div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 md:pt-0.5 lg:pt-0">
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-base md:text-base lg:text-lg">
				I enjoy working on products that solve real problems — especially when they start complex.
			</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-base md:text-base lg:text-lg">
				My approach is simple: understand the user, define what matters, and design solutions that feel
				effortless to use.
			</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-base md:text-base lg:text-lg">
				I’ve worked on both user-facing apps and internal systems, always focusing on making things clearer,
				faster, and more intuitive.
			</p>
			<a
				href="/portfolio/about"
				class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition md:text-base"
			>
				<span>Learn more about me and my work</span>
				<ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" width={20} height={20} className="shrink-0 stroke-2 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out hover:translate-x-1" />
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
